  "body": "Discover the ease of seaside living in this beautifully presented, easy-care sanctuary. Positioned on the iconic Esplanade, this charming unit offers a rare entry point into one of Eastern Beach's most sought-after locations. Whether you are looking to downsize, invest, or secure a stylish 'lock-up-and-leave' base, this property is all about lifestyle and location.\r\n\r\nThe Highlights:\r\n• Prestigious Location: Situated on the iconic Eastern Beach waterfront, enjoy immediate access to the beach, local cafes, and scenic coastal walks.\r\n• Spacious Living: Featuring a good-sized double bedroom and an open-plan living area that creates a warm, inviting atmosphere.\r\n• Modern Kitchen: A sleek, updated kitchen perfect for those who love to cook and entertain.\r\n• Pleasant Water Views: Enjoy lovely glimpses of the ocean from the comfort of your home—the perfect backdrop for your morning coffee.\r\n• Luxury Touches: The full bathroom features underfloor heating, adding a layer of comfort and modern sophistication.\r\n• Low Maintenance: Located within a secure, well-kept complex, this unit is the definition of 'lock-it-and-go.'\r\n\r\nPerfect For:\r\n• Downsizers: A safe, cozy, and manageable home for those looking to simplify their lives without compromising on quality or location.\r\n• Executive Couples: An ideal base for professionals who travel or those seeking a peaceful retreat at the end of a busy day.\r\n• Investors: Secure a high-demand rental property in a blue-chip coastal suburb & Macleans College zone.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this rare opportunity to secure a slice of The Esplanade—contact me today for a private viewing or join us at our next open home.",
